# BAI TOAN 3: "FILTER KENH CONTENT" — DUNG ARCH-010 PHAT HIEN "MOTIVATION PORN"

## Van de: Lam sao biet 1 kenh day kinh doanh CO GIA TRI hay chi la "cam hung rong"?

**ARCH-010 fires (Aspirational Content Interviewer):**

He thong da duoc train tu @toithanhcongbancungthe (8 video, 218K views). Day la archetype pho bien nhat tren TikTok/YouTube VN: PHONG VAN NGUOI GIAU + SIEU XE lam hook.

**8 markers phat hien (can 5/8 de ket luan):**

1. **Sieu xe/du thuyen/penthouse lam background** — dung do vat de anchor "thanh cong = giau" truoc khi noi dung bat dau
2. **Cau hoi "bi quyet thanh cong"** thay vi "unit economics la gi" — hoi sai tao tra loi sai
3. **Tra loi bang narrative** (cau chuyen) thay vi mechanics (con so) — "toi bat dau tu 0" nhung KHONG noi thang 1 doanh thu bao nhieu, chi phi bao nhieu
4. **Survivorship bias 100%** — chi phong van NGUOI THANG, 0 nguoi thua
5. **Hashtag #phattrienbanthan #thanhtcong #tuduylambgiau** — dau hieu content lam cho ALGORITHM, khong phai cho NGUOI HOC
6. **Khong co CTA ban san pham** (chua) — dang trong giai doan xay audience, chua monetize
7. **So lieu khong triangulate duoc** — "5 ty USD/nam" nhung khong ten cong ty de verify
8. **Loi khuyen chi work trong dieu kien CU THE** — "pivot sang medical supplies" chi work DUNG thoi Covid

**Cach su dung filter nay:**

Khi gap 1 kenh bat ky, dem so markers match. 
- 0-2: Co the co gia tri. Xem tiep.
- 3-4: CANH BAO. Doc/xem voi skepticism cao.
- 5-8: MOTIVATION PORN. Gia tri giao duc ~ 0. Neu xem, xem de GIAI TRI, khong phai de HOC.

